  "notes": [
    "Keys are 事業者名:路線名 exactly as in unkohonsu2026_rosen_kukan.txt; operators is the fallback for a line with no entry.",
    "Values are the operators' official line colours (signage and station-numbering colours); lines sharing a numbering group share its colour.",
